stateDiagram-v2
    %% D-82 derived lifecycle. The same contract is stored in app, com and org Ticket DBs.
    state "issued / unbound" as issued
    state "attached" as attached
    state "Base confirmed" as confirmed
    state "redeemed / admitted" as redeemed
    state "retired" as retired

    [*] --> issued: parent + binding transaction
    issued --> attached: Auth attach! / active sid + confirmation_ref
    issued --> retired: retire! / expiry or restart
    attached --> confirmed: confirm_base! / nonce digest + base token
    attached --> retired: retire! / expiry or restart
    confirmed --> redeemed: redeem! / rotated admitted sid
    confirmed --> retired: retire! / expiry or restart
    redeemed --> [*]: retained terminal fact
    retired --> [*]: retained terminal fact

    note right of issued
      Exactly one parent:
      sign-in flow, OIDC transaction,
      or step-up transaction.
      Entry and confirmation refs are
      lookup identifiers, not proof.
    end note
